# React Hooks ESLint

Full patterns: `docs/skills/05-react-hooks-eslint.md`

## Errors to avoid
- `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` — no sync `setState` in `useEffect`/`useLayoutEffect` (incl. via `close()` helpers)
- `react-hooks/refs` — no `ref.current` read/write during render

## Use instead
- **Visibility/flags** — derive during render; local dismiss flag for user actions
- **Dialog reset** — `slotProps.transition.onEntered` + `handleClose`; render-time `dialogKey` reset for selection state
- **Props → local state** — render-time key check (`if (id !== syncedId) { setSyncedId(id); setField(...) }`)
- **JSX display values** — `useState`, not refs
- **Custom hooks** — update ref mirrors in `useEffect`; derive inactive status; `cleanup()` in effect, not `close()` if it sets state

## High-risk files
`*FormDialog.tsx`, `*PermissionsDialog.tsx`, `*RoleDialog.tsx`, `*SetupPrompt.tsx`, `shared/hooks/use*.ts`

## Do not
- `eslint-disable` these rules in feature code
- Add `useEffect` to copy props into state when render-time sync or `form.reset` suffices
